# Compilation Unit Definition (CUD) - Euclide + VCS filelist.
#     vcs -f build_gls.cud -sverilog -kdb -full64 +vcs+fsdbon
#
# Stage 3 - functional gate-level simulation of the SYNTHESISED,
#           scan-inserted netlist. No SDF back-annotation is applied.
#           run with:  make gls
# The 28nm std-cell simulation models are pulled on demand via -v (library file);
# the gate testbench instantiates ASIC_Top and neutralises the scan chains.
# Paths are relative to the final_script/ project root.
-v GLS/tcbn28hpcplusbwp30p140.v
synthesis/dataout/ASIC_Top_netlist.v
GLS/tb_asic.sv
